      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "verb masu stem + gachi\n　遅れます　⇒　遅れがち = tends to be late\n\nnoun + gachi\n　怒りがち = tends to anger (get angry)\n\nnote: many verbs can be turned into nouns by using a -ri ending.\n\n　怒る【いかる】(v5r) to get angry, to be angry\n　怒り【いかり】(n) anger, hatred, (P)\n ⇒ 怒りがち",
      "html": "verb masu stem + gachi<br/>　遅れます　⇒　遅れがち = tends to be late<br/><br/>noun + gachi<br/>　怒りがち = tends to anger (get angry)<br/><br/>note: many verbs can be turned into nouns by using a -ri ending.<br/><br/>　怒る【いかる】(v5r) to get angry, to be angry<br/>　怒り【いかり】(n) anger, hatred, (P)<br/> ⇒ 怒りがち",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "36247d901a86fddd5e296fc2ef0b1200f5ddf77649b7adcb61148b201e5096fc",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
